/E (ASK Bagbin Education Fund is a non-profit education foundation established to address persistent educational inequalities in Ghana. The Foundation responds to systemic barriers that limit access to education, reduce school completion rates, and undermine learning outcomes particularly among girls, children from low-income households, and learners in rural and underserved communities.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
>>
