191 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 108 0 R
/E (The ASK Bagbin Education Fund is dedicated to advancing inclusive and equitable education in Ghana. The Foundation works to remove financial, social, and structural barriers to education by supporting vulnerable learners, strengthening community engagement, and collaborating with government institutions, development partners, and the private sector. Our work focuses on expanding access to education, improving learning environments, promoting gender equity, and ensuring that no child is left behind due to poverty, geography, or social disadvantage. The Foundation operates with a strong commitment to transparency, accountability, and long-term sustainability.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
